eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/a2ef2d16bbd8cb2c3a1ee671aab7ea4b.avif?t=1771850454\" width=579 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shifting maps where no two runs are ever the same. Each route presents new events, unpredictable rewards, and bosses that can appear in different sequences. Your decisions on the map are just as important as your decisions in combat.\u00a0Let your deck spiral, twist the map\u2019s fate, and break the run in ways the void never intended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/44cf9c89cbc51278deb16ad1813e9dbc.poster.avif?t=1771850454\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/44cf9c89cbc51278deb16ad1813e9dbc.webm?t=1771850454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/extras/44cf9c89cbc51278deb16ad1813e9dbc.mp4?t=1771850454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now when reality starts folding\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be the one to reach the True Ending and survive what\u2019s inside?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["StoryCropStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2223420/header.jpg?t=1771850454","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2024 \u00a9 StoryCropStudio / LoveStoryProject","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2223420/995763221/dae3dddccc48cd317b567305